    "ctx_fact": 0.0,
    "answer_fact": 0.0,
    "grounded": 0.0,
    "answer": "The alert **PaymentDeclineRateHigh** is handled by the runbook **RB\u2011PAY\u2011DECLINES**\u202f[RB-PAY-DECLINES#0.0].  \nThe service that owns the alert is **SVC\u2011PAYMENTS** (owner: TEAM\u2011PAY)\u202f[SVC-PAYMENTS#0.0].\n\nThe escalation contact (on\u2011call rota, pager, etc.) is not listed in the provided context, so I cannot specify it here.",
