    "answer_fact": 1.0,
    "grounded": 1.0,
    "answer": "Page the Platform on\u2011call first: Kamel\u202fBenyahia (primary on the ONC\u2011PLATFORM rota) [ONC-PLATFORM#0.0].",
    "answer_judge": 1.0,
    "faithful": 1.0
   },
   {
    "id": "M04",
    "kind": "multi",
    "recall": 1.0,
    "full": 1.0,
    "mrr": 0.5,
    "fact": 1.0,
    "ctx_fact": 1.0,
    "answer_fact": 0.0,
    "grounded": 1.0,
    "answer": "The services that depend directly on **redis\u2011cache** are:\n\n- **auth-service** \u2013 depends on SVC\u2011REDIS for session cache [SVC-AUTH#0.0]  \n- **storefront\u2011web** \u2013 depends on SVC\u2011REDIS for page cache [SVC-STOREFRONT#0.0]  \n- **checkout\u2011api** \u2013 depends on SVC\u2011REDIS for cart storage [SVC-CHECKOUT#0.0]",
    "answer_judge": 1.0,
    "faithful": 1.0
   },
   {
    "id": "M05",
    "kind": "multi",
    "recall": 1.0,
    "full": 1.0,
    "mrr": 0.5,
    "fact": 0.0,
    "ctx_fact": 0.0,
    "answer_fact": 0.0,
    "grounded": 0.0,
    "answer": "If **SVC\u2011MAINDB** goes down, all services that list it as a dependency will fail:\n\n| Service | ID | Dependency on main\u2011db | Impact |\n|---------|----|-----------------------|--------|\n| orders\u2011service | **SVC\u2011ORDERS** | critical | API calls time out, order processing stops |\n| payments\u2011gateway | **SVC\u2011PAYMENTS** | payment records | payment processing fails |\n| catalog\u2011service | **SVC\u2011CATALOG** | critical | product data unavailable |\n| auth\u2011service | **SVC\u2011AUTH** | user accounts | login and session creation fail |\n\nThese dependencies are shown in the graph paths:  \n- `SVC\u2011ORDERS <-[DEPENDS_ON]- SVC\u2011MAINDB` [SVC-ORDERS]  \n- `SVC\u2011PAYMENTS <-[DEPENDS_ON]- SVC\u2011MAINDB` [SVC-PAYMENTS]  \n- `SVC\u2011CATALOG <-[DEPENDS_ON]- SVC\u2011MAINDB` [SVC-CATALOG]  \n- `SVC\u2011AUTH <-[DEPENDS_ON]- SVC\u2011MAINDB` [SVC-AUTH]",
    "answer_judge": 1.0,
    "faithful": 1.0
   },
   {
    "id": "M06",
    "kind": "multi",
    "recall": 0.5,
    "full": 0.0,
    "mrr": 1.0,
    "fact": 1.0,
    "ctx_fact": 1.0,
    "answer_fact": 0.0,
    "grounded": 1.0,
    "answer": "The outage was caused by the Redis service (SVC\u2011REDIS).  \nThe owner of SVC\u2011REDIS is not listed in the provided documents, so the team that owns it cannot be identified from this context.",
    "answer_judge": 0.0,
    "faithful": 1.0
   },
   {
    "id": "M07",
    "kind": "multi",
    "recall": 1.0,
    "full": 1.0,
    "mrr": 1.0,
    "fact": 0.0,
    "ctx_fact": 0.0,
    "answer_fact": 0.0,
    "grounded": 1.0,
    "answer": "After the August\u202f2025 card\u2011payment outage, the team decided to:\n\n* Add an alert that triggers 30\u202fdays before any external certificate expires, to be in place by\u202f2025\u201108\u201131.  \n* Add a feature flag that can switch checkout to cash\u2011on\u2011delivery only, to be enabled by\u202f2025\u201108\u201120.  \n* Adopt a policy to monitor and automate external certificates.  \n\nThese decisions are recorded in the post\u2011mortem [PM\u20112025\u201108#3.0] and the ADR [ADR\u2011003#1.0].",
    "answer_judge": 0.0,
    "faithful": 1.0
   },
   {
    "id": "M08",
    "kind": "multi",
    "recall": 1.0,
    "full": 1.0,
    "mrr": 1.0,
    "fact": 0.0,
    "ctx_fact": 0.0,
    "answer_fact": 0.0,
    "grounded": 0.0,
    "answer": "The old Redis restart runbook (RB\u2011REDIS\u2011RESTART) was superseded by **RB\u2011REDIS\u2011FAILOVER** [RB-REDIS-RESTART#0.0][RB-REDIS-FAILOVER#0.0].  \nIn the material provided, RB\u2011REDIS\u2011FAILOVER does not contain any explicit instruction about restarting the primary Redis instance.",
    "answer_judge": 0.0,
    "faithful": 1.0
   },
   {
